60
00:03:33.525 --> 00:03:35.694
Oh. my god.

61
00:03:35.778 --> 00:03:37.947
See you tomorrow.
See ya.

62
00:03:38.155 --> 00:03:39.156
Yeah.

63
00:03:42.034 --> 00:03:43.327
Jessica. what the fuck?

64
00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.414
Look. Clay. I'm sorry. but you know
