Fun!

242
00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.374
Hey. get your sleep. Ok?

243
00:12:55.337 --> 00:12:56.963
I guess we're going camping.

244
00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:59.174
The legend of burnham woods.

245
00:12:59.257 --> 00:13:03.637
Some kids were partying in.
like. ancient times. like the '80s.

246
00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:05.972
